  "description": "Chartink translation (20 Oct 2026), end-of-day basis: evaluated on completed daily candles at the previous close, so the list is fixed for the whole next session. Today's range narrower than each of the last 7 days (NR7), red daily candle below the day before, red week and red month, volume > 10,000 the day before, daily SMA20 < SMA40 < SMA60, volume > 1.25x the day before.",
